WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:06.312
Every morning, a school runs on registers, receipt books, and a dozen WhatsApp groups.

2
00:00:06.812 --> 00:00:15.422
Who's absent? Who hasn't paid? Where's that TC request? The answers are scattered everywhere.

3
00:00:16.822 --> 00:00:24.376
Meet Infovion. The academic management platform built for Indian schools, from kindergarten to class twelve.

4
00:00:24.876 --> 00:00:27.436
Everything your school needs, in one place.

5
00:00:28.836 --> 00:00:36.126
It starts at admission. Track every inquiry as a lead, from the first call to an enrolled student.

6
00:00:36.626 --> 00:00:41.968
Admit students in minutes, or bring your whole school in at once with a CSV import.

7
00:00:43.368 --> 00:00:47.543
Teachers mark attendance class by class, in just a few taps.

8
00:00:48.043 --> 00:00:53.077
Each teacher sees only their own classes, so your data stays clean and private.

9
00:00:54.477 --> 00:00:56.549
Build the weekly timetable once.

10
00:00:57.049 --> 00:01:01.315
When a teacher is absent, assign a substitute cover in seconds.

11
00:01:02.715 --> 00:01:06.075
Create exams and enter marks subject by subject.

12
00:01:06.575 --> 00:01:11.156
Report cards are generated automatically, on your school's own letterhead.

13
00:01:12.556 --> 00:01:17.909
Fees are where a school office loses the most time. Infovion fixes that.

14
00:01:18.409 --> 00:01:24.103
Set fee plans with installments, and apply concessions like sibling discounts or scholarships.

15
00:01:24.603 --> 00:01:31.997
Collect by cash, UPI, cheque, bank transfer, or online through Razorpay, with a receipt every time.

16
00:01:32.497 --> 00:01:35.297
And the defaulters list is always one click away.

17
00:01:36.697 --> 00:01:43.171
Parents get their own portal, with attendance, marks, fee status and announcements, the same day.

18
00:01:43.671 --> 00:01:48.668
They can message the class teacher directly, without sharing personal phone numbers.

19
00:01:50.068 --> 00:01:52.813
Send an announcement to every portal at once.

20
00:01:53.313 --> 00:01:57.642
And keep holidays, exams and events on one shared school calendar.

21
00:01:59.042 --> 00:02:04.701
Transfer certificates, bonafide and character certificates are ready to print in seconds.

22
00:02:05.201 --> 00:02:09.503
Student ID cards print four to a page, all with your school's branding.

23
00:02:10.903 --> 00:02:15.268
Track staff attendance and set salary structures for every employee.

24
00:02:15.768 --> 00:02:20.708
Monthly salary slips are generated for you. No spreadsheets needed.

25
00:02:22.108 --> 00:02:25.460
Principals and directors see the whole school at a glance.

26
00:02:25.960 --> 00:02:33.098
Today's attendance, pending requests, class-wise exam averages, and which teachers haven't marked attendance yet.

27
00:02:34.498 --> 00:02:38.776
At the end of the year, promote whole classes to the next grade in one step.

28
00:02:40.176 --> 00:02:44.414
There are eight dedicated portals, one for every role in your school.

29
00:02:44.914 --> 00:02:50.510
Every change is recorded in the audit log, and two-factor login keeps accounts secure.

30
00:02:51.910 --> 00:02:55.759
So, what makes Infovion different from other school software?

31
00:02:56.259 --> 00:03:09.019
First, one price with everything included. Many systems sell fees, exams or the parent app as separate add-ons. With Infovion, every module is yours from day one.

32
00:03:09.519 --> 00:03:22.328
Second, it's built for Indian schools. UPI and cheque payments, installments, sibling concessions, transfer certificates and bonafides all work the way your office already does.

33
00:03:22.828 --> 00:03:32.517
Third, every person gets their own portal. From the director to the receptionist, each role sees exactly what they need, and nothing they shouldn't.

34
00:03:33.017 --> 00:03:39.655
Fourth, parents and teachers talk inside the app, so teachers never have to share their personal phone numbers.

35
00:03:40.155 --> 00:03:49.676
And finally, there's nothing to install. Infovion runs in the browser on any computer or phone, and we take care of the servers and updates.

36
00:03:51.076 --> 00:03:56.800
The result? Less paperwork for your office. Faster fee collection.

37
00:03:57.300 --> 00:04:02.495
Parents who stay informed. And a principal who always knows what's happening.

38
00:04:03.895 --> 00:04:05.310
And the pricing is simple.

39
00:04:05.810 --> 00:04:09.216
Just ₹150, per student, per year.

40
00:04:11.895 --> 00:04:13.348
Book a free demo today.

41
00:04:13.848 --> 00:04:19.842
Visit www.infovion.in, or call us on +91 91563 02024.
